Problem: Majority Element (LC 169)

Pattern: Frequency Counting (HashMap)

Approach:

1. Create a HashMap to store the frequency of each number.
2. Traverse the array and increase the frequency of every element.
3. Traverse the HashMap.
4. If any element's frequency is greater than `n/2`, return that element.

Time Complexity: O(n)

Space Complexity: O(n)
